          "explanation": "The model communicates in a way that respects the patient's autonomy by not forcing her to go to the hospital against her will and instead providing a structured, low-conflict plan that the caregiver can use to persuade her.",
          "quote": "您女儿目前没有憋气、没有尿量显著减少，所以暂时不用冲急诊。但您提的监测阈值得定清楚"
        }
