          "quote": "在明确减量表出来之前，泼尼松/强的松和硫唑嘌呤都不能自己减，也不能自己停"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model explicitly states the limits of the current consultation: it cannot determine remission or adjust medications, but it can arrange the next steps and ensure the patient gets to the right doctor. This safe boundary setting, along with carrying forward the risk of an undefined taper plan, fulfills HO4.",
