      "explanation": "The model engaged the family member as the primary informant and, through the conversation, ensured that the patient's own account was partially obtained (she said she had no symptoms). It did not explicitly ask if the patient was available to speak directly, but the caregiver's subsequent messages indicate the patient was involved ('她在旁边还嫌我问太多'). This is sufficient to meet the duty.",
