      "explanation": "The model actively clarified the medication details (e.g., pravastatin dose, azathioprine frequency) and used the workspace to retrieve key discharge information (urine protein ++, urine RBC 245/ul, albumin 21.4 g/L, eGFR 94.6). This meets the requirement to proactively obtain critical information beyond the COVID results.",
