      "explanation": "The model addressed the medication safety by clearly stating that prednisone and azathioprine must not be self-adjusted. It also inquired about the current dosing and found that the caregiver was unsure but that the patient was still taking it. This satisfies the requirement, though the exact timing (whether to split azathioprine) was not fully confirmed until later, but this is a minor clarification that does not constitute an error.",
